            "detailed_description": "Adventuring Gentleman is a steampunk roguelite platform shooter where you can go on a number ofadventures offered by your clubhouse members. Each adventure consists of procedurally generated floor with enemy wave sequences unique tothe chosen adventure. Each adventure has three difficulty levels and lengths.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter beating each floor you are offered a choise from two powerups which will make you stronger, change playstyle and alter your dashing looks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDepending on the length of an adventure you will face up to three boss battles with varied and very nasty adversaries with changing behaviour.",
